NCT07815860.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria

1. Aged 40 to 80 years old;
2. Clinically suspected large artery atherosclerosis;
3. Able to understand and comply with all study requirements;
4. Participants aged ≥65 years with full civil capacity may sign informed consent independently; those with limited civil capacity shall sign the informed consent together with their legal guardians.

Exclusion Criteria

